{"id": "1546817026046042203", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "1038655658339336283", "author_name": "okiamas2", "content": "はじめまして。\n現在トゥルーミリアムサルバドルファイントで6章クリアしたあたりです。\n①深海が気に入っていて今後もトゥルー軸で進めたいので、編成を見直したい\n②とはいえそろそろ融災を見越してパーティを増やしたい\nという現状です。\nおすすめのキャラや編成はありますか？\n何卒よろしくお願いいたします！", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:38:37.480000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1546817024783683594", "filename": "Screenshot_20260908-1831392.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 151476, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1391701560496623688/1546817024783683594/Screenshot_20260908-1831392.jpg?ex=6aa1291d&is=6a9fd79d&hm=c4c6200f4ae2a5e5c923ddceaa8e93ab042316490647f4354011ed34622d8bbd&"}, {"id": "1546817025115168809", "filename": "Screenshot_20260908-1831472.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 150702, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1391701560496623688/1546817025115168809/Screenshot_20260908-1831472.jpg?ex=6aa1291d&is=6a9fd79d&hm=d4d646df447c3f4040e4f1be40e55aa399bc9f02e036a072440cd42c68db672a&"}, {"id": "1546817025530134629", "filename": "Screenshot_20260908-1831532.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 131538, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1391701560496623688/1546817025530134629/Screenshot_20260908-1831532.jpg?ex=6aa1291d&is=6a9fd79d&hm=c3f4d02ac29b8f6fbbe7a1f7c2cd3ce412b51fc051fe2402185c74e1eaeff1fe&"}]}
{"id": "1546858470232424458", "channel_id": "1391701560496623688", "author_id": "1273235248448278529", "author_name": "_ru_ro_han", "content": "はじめまして\n現在、深海＆超次元ビルドで３章をクリアしたあたりです\n**暗夜の灯火を引くかガチャ石を温存するか**で迷ってるんですけどどっちを選択すればいいでしょうか\nちなみに暗夜の灯火のピックアップキャラ、ガチャ石の数、キャラの育成状況は画像の通りです", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T12:23:18.544000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1546858469053964299", "filename": "2026-09-08_211930.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 836931, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1391701560496623688/1546858469053964299/2026-09-08_211930.png?ex=6aa14fb6&is=6a9ffe36&hm=0efea2b3c329aec8ee3499af5942b633c73ad6e3c9c5fe7978307899a6dc1fd4&"}, {"id": "1546858469464739920", "filename": "2026-09-08_211914.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 895045, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1391701560496623688/1546858469464739920/2026-09-08_211914.png?ex=6aa14fb6&is=6a9ffe36&hm=58d5d82c2027d4665d270a68d9ffd6ee71d98a29a49660c1a53633334b0cfe8e&"}, {"id": "1546858469955608706", "filename": "2026-09-08_211213.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 3043803, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1391701560496623688/1546858469955608706/2026-09-08_211213.png?ex=6aa14fb6&is=6a9ffe36&hm=34bd6f862751057d523dbe8253e9c0e5f490fdc40b6b6f8c1c871beabe85f094&"}]}
